[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3502062444","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112504#issuecomment-3502062444","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112504","id":3502062444,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QvTts","user":{"login":"groud","id":6093119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwOTMxMTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6093119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud","html_url":"https://github.com/groud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-07T11:38:04Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T11:38:04Z","body":"It helps, but IMO the problem is maybe a bit there now:\r\n![not aligned](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20beb6f0-61ba-4795-b1de-7cda116f8549)\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3502062444/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3502306224","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112504#issuecomment-3502306224","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112504","id":3502306224,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QwPOw","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-07T12:34:28Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T12:34:28Z","body":"@groud I found that the extra margin is coming from the focus stylebox. While it can be reduced, it can't be reduced all the way to zero because then there will be no space to draw the focus border:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"438\" height=\"259\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/168478a0-da2f-4c17-b96c-735aa76b2a6e\" /><br>\r\n\r\nIf it can't be reduced to zero then it's probably better to leave at current value because a 2px misalignment would be much more triggering than a regular padding that looks intentional.\r\n\r\nIf focus wasn't an issue then I'd say aligning those would require slightly increasing the margin of the dock (around everything including header) because otherwise that loss of inner space is starting to get noticeable and it's starting to look a bit heavy:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"586\" height=\"471\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/17fc36e3-3ce9-4b86-becf-2bf3eb52ea0b\" />\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3502306224/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3502331741","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112504#issuecomment-3502331741","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112504","id":3502331741,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QwVdd","user":{"login":"groud","id":6093119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwOTMxMTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6093119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud","html_url":"https://github.com/groud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-07T12:40:43Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T12:40:43Z","body":"Well to align things maybe we could also add some padding around the header part, and maybe compensate by reducing whole dock padding accordingly ? Then we can adjust everything with the dock's padding.\r\n\r\n> If it can't be reduced to zero then it's probably better to leave at current value because a 2px misalignment would be much more triggering than a regular padding that looks intentional.\r\n\r\nTrue.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3502331741/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3502538064","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112504#issuecomment-3502538064","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112504","id":3502538064,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QxH1Q","user":{"login":"ErnSur","id":32190237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTkwMjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32190237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur","html_url":"https://github.com/ErnSur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-07T13:21:51Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T13:36:55Z","body":"> If focus wasn't an issue then I'd say aligning those would require slightly increasing the margin of the dock (around everything including header) because otherwise that loss of inner space is starting to get noticeable and it's starting to look a bit heavy:\r\n> \r\n> <img alt=\"image\" width=\"586\" height=\"471\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/60579014/511310990-17fc36e3-3ce9-4b86-becf-2bf3eb52ea0b.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..Jjx_iDouVXA0ThPQ5pM8YYJ5AxYPhFRmFTiw2yMGZMg\">\r\n\r\n@passivestar Are you saying that the visuals on the second screenshot you attached are bad?\r\nI'd say they finally look correct to me.\r\n\r\nI was looking for a PR like this because ever since I started working with Godot I was irked by the unnecessary extra margin around many of the UI elements. It's very noticeable if you're working on a laptop.\r\nHere are some examples:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"249\" height=\"347\" alt=\"inspector\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9024ca23-814e-414c-939b-5e3421025594\" />\r\n<img width=\"242\" height=\"684\" alt=\"sceneAndFiles\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f1a9ed5c-2216-4115-8f5f-ec96e48d37f7\" />\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3502538064/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3502647961","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112504#issuecomment-3502647961","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112504","id":3502647961,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QxiqZ","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-07T13:44:08Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T13:44:08Z","body":"> @passivestar Are you saying the the visuals on the second screenshot you attached are bad?\r\nI'd say they finally look correct to me.\r\n\r\nAligning those is good but the dock could use a few more pixels of horizontal padding\r\n\r\n> I was looking for a PR like this because ever since I started working with Godot I was irked by the unnecessary extra padding around many of the UI elements. It's very noticeable if you're working on a laptop.\r\n\r\nYou don't need a PR to reduce all paddings at once, there's a \"Base Spacing\" editor setting that you can use. But it shouldn't be too crammed by default","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3502647961/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3503413596","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112504#issuecomment-3503413596","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112504","id":3503413596,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Q0dlc","user":{"login":"ErnSur","id":32190237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTkwMjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32190237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur","html_url":"https://github.com/ErnSur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-07T16:06:32Z","updated_at":"2025-11-10T18:27:19Z","body":"> You don't need a PR to reduce all paddings at once, there's a \"Base Spacing\" editor setting that you can use. But it shouldn't be too crammed by default\r\n\r\nI'd say that the problem is that too many elements use the base spacing into consideration. Some UI containers should simply ignore it since their hierarchy ancestor already takes care of it.\r\n\r\nLet's say I'm designing a Inspector UI hierarchy like so:\r\n- VBox\r\n  - HBox\r\n    - SearchBox\r\n    - Button\r\n  - TreeView\r\n\r\nIf I apply a horizontal margin to the first VBox then I don't want to apply the extra margin to \"HBox\". Its there to simply layout other elements.\r\n\r\nHere's the Inspector window with the base spacing set to 8. I'm arguing that the headers should not have the extra indent **and** the scroll bar should  stick to the right window border and the margin space should be applied to the left of it instead. \r\n<img width=\"365\" height=\"498\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-11-07 at 17 01 47\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/487f6c77-50b6-4b80-9ec1-1244f353fa14\" />\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3503413596/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3602114452","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112504#issuecomment-3602114452","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112504","id":3602114452,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ws-eU","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T13:37:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T13:37:00Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3602114452/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]